      <name>水神宮</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw7WxOFMgPwgDjTx2gOeqymGfloyAcch6GktiE-fvOYcQJV8xshwUsvg4Tn23DX57Y8-EUgjElUIiq-S2p80dBAD_FZ6aySuj4NiBobveUexxrY0Y_uejHLMcpqee9qY1IEmxFjDh_TBn560kckCWjQtA0MRb3EF6EW7m2qq6CxpAJ_8wyOrBYjRmtiQqRwj-zlPQTj7mGN4M1DCwPk9dTu_Jxl6PK0MALJ935wU4rDRvkl49i6cJfgnMQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>水神宮　槻川（柳町橋の右岸橋詰）<br><br>埼玉県比企郡小川町下里<br>明治17年（1884）12月建立。昭和25年（1950）遷宮。緑泥片岩を使った高さ87cm、幅46cmの大きな水神宮<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxBAxFIk4Lm943RZiYETJMQWUAmqXsc2ATEVCzvngEe9cP0Adv1hyAfrW2LulknZcf5pan5G93uNPr9ajeSuk6bkfMPsWoU0zWaxYkiwHgdyzaj9vJYXlVf74nsoBy6tXupytIBIwiTVGt2D8yGKqf0cakazBu3An4fS1fkyuBu7L8Tb0d2aboZgwxVdwMc4nbaVQIA0cIUP3YGh9vVNA21nh8NJk094swUUGbTTJG3uhWT_hvTGYl8a7A?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
