      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7zp6-a3S0ttGKwUQX2oj7T0hElXNLShjc8zDTZaKTPiXMCfWgte10IOzbLaEzFlWkAv5gDNLK3fzRoB8rSTa7k1ErUF8V6oriY0BSzY3Zm6lJ3J7Ds0z9hrofFAMzg9H4D1MuPITOA8xJGtSkSxEpIaMw0HHn6HXiqTMUHuYs4KUWzXqLOYGOGxP85I3994C35hWpAoMdg3VpWFhuAuIl2iGgIAW4dd_YFR2JRoaJXoLZK44ZGNFho5VG1ffcTUa1ZpCpMgYhS41piBnPaZn_IMCZ6YU-VSJk0PlqrEWU4R46xPfW-BqTG5qWAPdTQkT6T_w7mw73H1AZQAtAn4cTK0OAX17l6u0GcaWXEFSd1h_fVcpnfU1eTheCf24Bc9PT7dAR3knOFH9ilKstb23NjJIGRcH6isaL_nZUWdszKbP2aaVKNSM9DaKk8I2lHPBWLmrwc1hytUg0g5X5jaOhnNq0pdXF9pQlGgHMlC1uOd6PR_0oaByGsIkvdrUenymH2Cr0zHtNAM9XVvJm8jfpvScEiH9qbCVdo4gky9u6E481Z3bQz0POHp5l2eNU3S1r5g3B9kzGq9Cwxpe-c81XpbEj9mKObGLvtQ3fB7c06gwT5yBY6a8VcyOV3ZzYnBTVrwQmuIStKgkOb3LAOHaoF8LOEAPz_2G4jA9-bYbmTIOEzppuLFxY1nvrAPzrcj-miOoUvqNqF0hydq8ryiZr73Kp2kw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>「入間川の水運」収録。<br>「明治十七年一月建、出丸中郷祭主 加藤<br>幸三郎」銘。<br><br>水神宮　入間川（左岸）<br>　　比企郡川島町出丸中郷<br>　　円福寺から北へ200mの民家の入り口<br>　　明治十七年（1884）一月<br>　　祭主　出丸中郷　加藤某]]></description>
